&lt;h2&gt;Arbeiten bei WPP Media:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als WPP Media gestalten wir die Zukunft der Medien und investieren dabei konsequent in unsere Mitarbeiter:innen. Jede:r Kolleg:in genießt die Vorteile des globalen Netzwerks von WPP Media und WPP, um sich weiterzuentwickeln&amp;nbsp;und an der Spitze von Marketing und Werbung zu lernen. Vielfalt und Zusammenhalt leben wir durch zahlreiche Employee Resource Groups und regelmäßige interne Events - zum Austausch, zur Inspiration und zum gemeinsamen Feiern unserer Erfolge.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit fördert. Wir berücksichtigen alle Bewerber:innen für alle Positionen ohne Diskriminierung. Unser Ziel ist eine Kultur des Respekts und der Zugehörigkeit, in der jede:r die gleichen Möglichkeiten hat, sich einzubringen und beruflich zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte lies unsere &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt; für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz, um weitere Informationen darüber zu erhalten, wie wir die von dir bereitgestellten Daten verarbeiten.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Director&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Amsterdam/Rotterdam, hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp;amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp;amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is part of our&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; Experience &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; team based in the Netherlands. We combine our skills in developing future-ready technical solutions with our expertise in creating beautiful designs to deliver exceptional and engaging digital experiences that build lasting relationships with our clients like Gant, Inter Milan, bol.com and Just Eat Takeaway.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Growth Director who is hungry to build something. In this role, you will identify and develop new business opportunities for our Netherlands team, helping ambitious brands solve complex digital challenges through the combined power of technology, design, and strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you thrive on finding the right clients, crafting compelling pitches, and seeing your work turn into lasting partnerships, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement &amp;amp; Relationship Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and nurture relationships with marketing and technology decision-makers at prospect organisations, translating their challenges into clear, compelling solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent DEPT® with confidence in client conversations, demonstrating knowledge across digital experience, engineering, and emerging technologies like AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales &amp;amp; Pipeline Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and qualify new business opportunities through direct outreach, events, partnerships, and collaboration with the marketing team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage your own pipeline end-to-end, from first contact to signed proposal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use CRM tools (e.g., Salesforce) to track activity, report on progress, and develop good habits around forecasting and pipeline hygiene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Pitching&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with delivery leads, solution architects, and strategists to build proposals and pitches that showcase DEPT®&#39;s strengths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop familiarity with our key technology partners (e.g., Shopify, Adobe, Optimizely) and understand how those partnerships create opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in business development, consultative sales, or a client-facing role with a strong commercial component, within a digital agency, tech consultancy, or related environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling project-based work, with exposure to digital experience, content management and publishing, ecommerce, or technology services. Familiarity with solutions like CMS, PIM, DAM, or content supply chain is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable engaging with senior stakeholders at manager and director level, with the ambition to grow into C-level conversations over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured approach to prospecting and pipeline management, you know how to keep deals moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator who can explain complex ideas in straightforward, client-friendly language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative by nature, you enjoy working across teams and bringing people together around a pitch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Dutch and English language&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to digital experience platforms, ecommerce solutions, or cloud/technology services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with multi-stakeholder sales cycles and how to navigate them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in how AI and emerging technology are reshaping digital services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE OFFER:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible, hybrid working policy (2-3 days from the office, depending on location) and the opportunity to work from abroad for 13 weeks a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24 vacation days per year and the possibility to buy an unlimited number of extra vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DEPT®/YOU Learning Menu and DEPT®/YOU Special Programs. Develop your skills with courses and programs tailored to your needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay happy and healthy with a contribution to your health through the OpenUp platform, gym and wellness discounts, and healthy lunches at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get a discount on your lease bike and ride in style. You can also enjoy hassle free-commutes with an NS Business Card.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reputation for doing good. DEPT® has been a Certified B Corp® since 2021, has been named a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.nl/en/certification/certified/dept&quot;&gt;Great Place To Work since 2022&lt;/a&gt; in the Netherlands and named ‘Agency of the Year’ at both The Lovies and The Webby Awards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome clients. Whether big, small, local or global — at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with all of them. And we celebrate all of our successes together!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can discover even more employee benefits &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/nl-nl/employee-benefits/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY DEPT®?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, we create what is next by pioneering ideas, acting fast, and moving further because standing still just is not in our DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are drawn to people who stay curious, move with intent, and never stop inventing. Our culture runs on three values: better together, relentlessly curious, and get sh*t done. It is how we work, how we grow, and how we make things that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you will find the freedom to explore, the space to collaborate, and the trust to make a real impact for our clients, for each other, and for the world we are helping to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, we take pride in creating an inclusive workplace where everyone has an equal opportunity to thrive. We actively seek to recruit, develop, nurture, and retain talented individuals from diverse backgrounds, with varying skills and perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not sure you meet all qualifications? Apply, and let us decide! Research shows that women and members of underrepresented groups tend not to apply for jobs when they think they may not meet every requirement, when in fact they do. We believe in giving everyone a fair chance to shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also encourage you to reach out to us and discuss any reasonable adjustments we can make to support you throughout the recruitment process and your time with us.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Want to know more about our dedication to diversity, equity, and inclusion? Check out our efforts &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/the-good-company/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Student Labs: Constructor Fabric Research Edition&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious how AI is changing the way software is built? Want to explore it hands-on, guided by the researchers who work on it every day?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Constructor Tech and Constructor Labs, together with Constructor University, invite you to &lt;strong&gt;Student Labs&lt;/strong&gt;: a 2-month educational research program for BSc and MSc students.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This edition is dedicated to &lt;strong&gt;Constructor Fabric&lt;/strong&gt;, a shared AI and software platform. Fabric brings together reusable building blocks, common infrastructure and AI agents that help design, build and test software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;🚀 Why Constructor Fabric?&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI-native software platforms are one of the &lt;strong&gt;fastest-growing fields in tech&lt;/strong&gt;, and few students get to study one from the inside. Student Labs gives you that chance. You explore open research questions on a platform in active development, learn current research methods, and build skills that are in high demand in industry and academia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;🔬 What you can research&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI that builds software&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain-specific languages (DSL):&lt;/strong&gt; how a formal language can describe software components so that AI can generate and regenerate them from specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Neurosymbolic models:&lt;/strong&gt; combining neural networks with logic and rules, so that AI-generated code can be checked, not just produced&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rule extraction and fine-tuning:&lt;/strong&gt; how to extract rules and knowledge from existing code and use them to adapt language models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;World models:&lt;/strong&gt; how AI systems build an internal model of their environment to understand, plan and predict&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formal verification:&lt;/strong&gt; mathematical methods that prove software behaves as specified&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Geometric models:&lt;/strong&gt; using geometry to represent data and help AI models learn from it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benchmarking:&lt;/strong&gt; how to measure fairly whether one AI model or method is really better than another&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next-generation language models&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diffusion models for text:&lt;/strong&gt; today’s LLMs write one token at a time, which makes them slow and prone to hallucinations. Diffusion models generate whole passages at once. Explore how to make them match and beat today’s models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLM security:&lt;/strong&gt; how to host large language models securely when many users and organisations share the same system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;💡 What you’ll experience&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore an open research question that matches your level: beginner, intermediate or advanced&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn from weekly mentoring sessions with Constructor researchers and engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exchange ideas with other students, and study solo or in a pair&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present your results as a research report, prototype or research concept&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;🎓 Who can apply?&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BSc and MSc students of Constructor University and our partner universities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Students with a strong interest in AI, LLMs, software engineering or research. Beginners are welcome!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;👉 How it works&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Choose a topic&lt;/strong&gt; from a curated list proposed by our researchers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find your level.&lt;/strong&gt; Topics are offered for beginner, intermediate and advanced students, so everyone can find one that fits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Study solo or in a pair&lt;/strong&gt;, depending on the topic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead your own research&lt;/strong&gt; and set your own schedule, with weekly guidance from your mentor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Present your results&lt;/strong&gt; and receive feedback and a certificate of completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;⭐ Why join?&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Study a fast-growing field&lt;/strong&gt; from inside a real AI platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn from experts:&lt;/strong&gt; weekly mentorship from researchers and engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Earn academic credit:&lt;/strong&gt; depending on your university’s rules, the Labs can count towards your mandatory internship, earn you project credits, or become part of your thesis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Publish:&lt;/strong&gt; strong results can be published, with you as an author&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build your research portfolio&lt;/strong&gt; and receive a certificate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps:&lt;/strong&gt; thesis co-supervision, and you can apply for paid internships in the Constructor ecosystem (separate application)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📅 &lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; 2 months&lt;br&gt;📍 &lt;strong&gt;Format:&lt;/strong&gt; remote, or hybrid in Bremen (DE), Sofia (BG) or Belgrade (RS)&lt;br&gt;🗓 &lt;strong&gt;Mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; weekly sessions with your mentor. About 10–15 hours a week; you set your own schedule.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Student Labs is an educational research program, not a job or an internship. Participation is unpaid and voluntary.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam is the Data and AI Trust Company, specializing in helping organizations ensure their data and AI are fully understood, secured, and resilient to enable the acceleration of safe AI at scale. As the market leader in both data resilience and data security posture management, Veeam is built for the convergence of identity, data, security, and AI risk. Headquartered in Seattle with offices in more than 30 countries, Veeam protects over 550,000 customers worldwide, who trust Veeam to keep their businesses running. Join us as we go fearlessly forward together, growing, learning, and making a real impact for some of the world’s biggest brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über die Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Account Executive Commercial&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;bist du dafür verantwortlich, in deinem zugewiesenen Markt Geschäftsmöglichkeiten zu entwickeln und erfolgreich abzuschließen – in enger Zusammenarbeit mit unserem Partnervertrieb. Der Schwerpunkt liegt auf der Identifikation, Entwicklung und Beschleunigung von Vertriebschancen gemeinsam mit unseren Partnern sowie auf der erfolgreichen Realisierung von Abschlüssen und Up- und Cross-Selling-Potenzialen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standort: Raum Hamburg oder Bremen&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Dein Tätigkeitsfeld&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entwicklung und erfolgreicher Abschluss von Geschäftsmöglichkeiten mit definierten Kunden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zusammenarbeit mit Partnern zur erfolgreichen Umsetzung von Vertriebsabschlüssen bei deren Endkunden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aktive Neukundenansprache, einschließlich Kaltakquise, zur Entwicklung von Vertriebsaktivitäten mit einer Vielzahl neuer Endkunden im Mid-Market- und gehobenen Kundensegment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifikation und Umsetzung von Up-Selling- und Cross-Selling-Potenzialen innerhalb des bestehenden Kundenstamms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pflege von Forecasts sowie Account- und Opportunity-Informationen in Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vorschlag, Koordination und Teilnahme an Marketingaktivitäten im definierten Vertriebsgebiet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
