&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Coordinate with the GATE Core, GATE Infra, Authorization, and Tenant Scale (Cells and Organizations) teams across India, Europe, and the Americas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Make sure the team runs what it builds, including on-call coverage, incident response for authentication issues, rate limits, and production readiness for new services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Build a team culture where security comes first, decisions are written down, and code review is thorough and kind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Give clear, regular feedback, run career conversations, and handle performance issues early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Take part in on-call or operational support where your team’s ownership model requires it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
