&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Manager, Customer Success Managers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead a North America-based team that helps customers realize value from GitLab through strong adoption, measurable outcomes, and trusted partnership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner closely with both executive sponsors and day-to-day end users/practitioners to drive adoption and measurable outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Director of Customer Success Managers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, you will coach Customer Success Managers to support account health across onboarding, adoption stages, executive business reviews, and renewals, while also improving how the team works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a people leadership role with broad scope: you will develop talent, strengthen customer relationships, and partner across Sales, Product, Engineering, and other teams so customers are supported through growth, change, and escalation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; a team of Customer Success Managers focused on customer adoption, account health, customer satisfaction, and advocacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Coach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; team members through regular feedback, development support, and career growth conversations to strengthen knowledge, communication, and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Partner&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; with the Director of Customer Success Managers to define team goals, clarify responsibilities, and align priorities with company direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Manage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; resource assignments, staffing levels, and hiring activity to support team coverage and customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Develop&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; senior-level relationships with customers and support the team in building trusted advisor partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Collaborate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; with Sales, Product Management, Engineering, Professional Services, and other internal teams to create a consistent customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; customers during escalations by working with other leaders to coordinate clear, effective responses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Improve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; the processes and tools used by the team and oversee initiatives tied to objectives and key results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; leading customer-facing teams in software, technology, consulting, sales, or customer success environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Ability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; to guide teams that drive software adoption and manage customer relationships across onboarding, adoption, business reviews, and renewals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; of software development lifecycle practices, related tools, and agile or DevOps ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Familiarity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; with cloud or container technologies such as Kubernetes and Docker, application security concepts such as static application security testing (SAST) and dynamic application security testing (DAST), or cloud platforms such as Amazon Web Services (AWS), Google Cloud Platform (GCP), and Microsoft Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Skill&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; in translating strategy into clear initiatives, coordinating execution, and tracking delivery across competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Capability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; to lead distributed teams across regions, cultures, and lines of business, while working effectively with senior executives and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Willingness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; to travel occasionally for customer meetings and team events, as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Strength&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; in communication, coaching, feedback, delegation, planning, and process improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Warmth and care&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; in your leadership approach—able to coach with empathy and build trust on a human level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Interest&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; in candidates with transferable experience who can connect technical concepts to business value and collaborate well across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On the &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Customer Success Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; team, we are accountable for customer adoption, measurable outcomes, customer satisfaction, and building customer advocacy across GitLab.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also act as a key connection point between customers and the broader GitLab ecosystem, helping streamline collaboration with Product Management, Engineering, Sales, Professional Services, and other partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will manage a team in &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;North America&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; while collaborating asynchronously with stakeholders across regions, with a focus on helping customers succeed at scale and improving how the organization supports them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
